{
    "title": "Words: Associations Word Game",
    "description": "Explore the connections between the associated words and test your skills!\r\nWords\u2014Associations Word Game is a free, fun puzzle that challenges you to connect groups of four words with a common connection in an engaging word adventure.\r\n\r\nEach level is designed to sharpen your mind and expand your vocabulary through unlimited unique puzzles.\r\n\r\n<b>How to play: </b>\r\n\r\nExplore the 16-word grid and hunt for connections between groups of four words with similar characteristics. Hints are available to assist when needed, allowing you to make up to four mistakes while solving each puzzle.\r\n\r\n<b>Game Features: </b>\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udd13 Unlock a new word challenge everyday!\r\n\ud83c\udfae A simple and user-friendly word brain game for adults.\r\n\ud83e\udde0 Boost your vocabulary with relaxing mind exercises!\r\n\ud83d\udcda Engage with various zen puzzles to boost your IQ in your free time.\r\n\r\nThe Words - Associations Game is ideal for enhancing your vocabulary through engaging mental exercises.\r\n\r\nDownload now and start mastering new words today!",
    "descriptionHTML": "Explore the connections between the associated words and test your skills!<br>Words\u2014Associations Word Game is a free, fun puzzle that challenges you to connect groups of four words with a common connection in an engaging word adventure.<br><br>Each level is designed to sharpen your mind and expand your vocabulary through unlimited unique puzzles.<br><br><b>How to play: </b><br><br>Explore the 16-word grid and hunt for connections between groups of four words with similar characteristics. Hints are available to assist when needed, allowing you to make up to four mistakes while solving each puzzle.<br><br><b>Game Features: </b><br><br>\ud83d\udd13 Unlock a new word challenge everyday!<br>\ud83c\udfae A simple and user-friendly word brain game for adults.<br>\ud83e\udde0 Boost your vocabulary with relaxing mind exercises!<br>\ud83d\udcda Engage with various zen puzzles to boost your IQ in your free time.<br><br>The Words - Associations Game is ideal for enhancing your vocabulary through engaging mental exercises.<br><br>Download now and start mastering new words today!",
